WEBVTT

00:01:19.970 --> 00:01:20.180
<b>Lupin III</b>

00:01:20.220 --> 00:01:20.430
<b>Lupin III</b>

00:01:21.360 --> 00:01:23.930
Dear Lupin III...

00:01:23.930 --> 00:01:27.490
You're the grandson of Arsène Lupin, famed 
for your daring and mysterious adventures,

00:01:27.490 --> 00:01:31.690
and people even call you 
the smartest man in the world!

00:01:32.210 --> 00:01:35.940
You're so much more amazing 
than me and my bro...

00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:38.430
Mornin'!

00:01:40.410 --> 00:01:42.910
<b>Hirameki 
Inventions</b>

00:01:44.920 --> 00:01:46.400
Who's there?

00:01:46.400 --> 00:01:48.490
It's me! Your big bro!

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:50.180
No, you're not...

00:01:50.180 --> 00:01:53.100
Okay, lemme test ya! What's 1+1?

00:01:53.740 --> 00:01:56.040
Uh... five!

00:01:56.040 --> 00:01:57.620
It really is you!

00:01:57.630 --> 00:01:59.390
<b>Foreclosure</b>

00:01:59.390 --> 00:02:00.890
<b>Foreclosure</b>

00:02:00.890 --> 00:02:02.390
<b>Foreclosure</b>

00:02:02.730 --> 00:02:04.130
What the heck?

00:02:04.130 --> 00:02:05.680
Did you put these stickers up?!

00:02:04.140 --> 00:02:13.900
<b>Foreclosure</b>

00:02:05.680 --> 00:02:09.730
It wasn't me! Some guy turned up asking
for money, and stuck 'em on everything!

00:02:09.730 --> 00:02:11.810
They weren't here to make an order?

00:02:11.810 --> 00:02:13.910
Ooh, I'm hungry!

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:16.030
<b>Foreclosure</b>

00:02:15.030 --> 00:02:16.030
<b>Foreclosure</b>

00:02:16.010 --> 00:02:17.800
Holy moly, even the cabbage has one!

00:02:17.800 --> 00:02:20.400
They said if we don't pay our taxes, 
they're gonna take our stuff!

00:02:20.630 --> 00:02:21.910
Y'mean, everythin' they've marked?

00:02:22.480 --> 00:02:24.320
So this? And that?

00:02:25.290 --> 00:02:26.870
<b>Foreclosure</b>

00:02:25.420 --> 00:02:29.300
Even the roof? The whole 
place is covered in 'em!

00:02:29.300 --> 00:02:30.910
Upsy daisy...

00:02:31.190 --> 00:02:36.080
They said they're gonna take
the <i>entire</i> workshop Dad left us!

00:02:36.080 --> 00:02:38.720
Goodness gracious! So it'll all be gone, huh?

00:02:39.920 --> 00:02:44.690
Upsy daisy... Pardon us, folks. Coming through!

00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:46.690
Upsy daisy... Huh?

00:02:46.970 --> 00:02:48.590
Lupin!

00:02:49.450 --> 00:02:51.680
Forgive the intrusion, citizens.

00:02:51.680 --> 00:02:53.490
You're not getting away!

00:02:54.990 --> 00:02:57.450
I know! Lupin's the answer!

00:02:59.300 --> 00:03:01.380
"Lupin"? Is that what we're havin' for lunch?

00:03:01.690 --> 00:03:05.340
Lupin can help us save Dad's workshop!

00:03:09.040 --> 00:03:13.040
<b>Lupin vs. the Smart Safe</b>

00:03:13.100 --> 00:03:15.070
<b>Greater Tokyo Bank</b>

00:03:15.810 --> 00:03:16.510
Mr. President...

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:21.510
<b>Inspector 
Zenigata</b>

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:21.510
<b>Greater Tokyo Bank 
 President</b>

00:03:16.860 --> 00:03:20.200
I know Lupin tipped us off about his 
next heist, but isn't this a bit much?

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:21.500
Yes! You there!

00:03:21.770 --> 00:03:25.380
Is this a good idea? I mean, the infamous 
Lupin III has said he's going to steal from you.

00:03:26.100 --> 00:03:27.730
It's no problem at all—

00:03:27.730 --> 00:03:29.090
It's a huge problem!

00:03:29.090 --> 00:03:31.890
Neither Lupin nor anyone else can 
get past our security measures!

00:03:31.890 --> 00:03:36.150
Because, ladies and gentlemen,
 we have a new safe!

00:03:36.150 --> 00:03:37.150
Huh? What?

00:03:37.150 --> 00:03:38.150
<b>Special
Announcement</b>

00:03:38.140 --> 00:03:42.120
A lotta people are makin' a whole lotta 
fuss 'cause of that fake warnin' we did!

00:03:43.150 --> 00:03:45.170
Sir, if you would do the honors...

00:03:46.280 --> 00:03:47.990
<b>BRAINPOWER</b>

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:50.040
<b>We built 
a safe</b>

00:03:51.280 --> 00:03:53.280
Size isn't everything, you know?

00:03:53.280 --> 00:03:57.290
We've invented a safe that Lupin can't 
crack, no matter how hard he tries!

00:03:54.790 --> 00:03:57.290
<b>BRAINPOWER</b>

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:03.800
<b>BRAINPOWER</b>

00:03:59.240 --> 00:04:03.790
This safe measures a person's 
brainpower before it will open.

00:04:04.540 --> 00:04:07.580
Lupin III is the brainiest person in the world,
 with a brainpower rating of 300!

00:04:05.050 --> 00:04:06.300
Amazing

00:04:05.050 --> 00:04:10.770
Brain

00:04:05.050 --> 00:04:10.770
Power

00:04:07.550 --> 00:04:08.470
Not Amazing

00:04:08.470 --> 00:04:11.550
Then, you have my big brother, 
who has zero brainpower!

00:04:11.800 --> 00:04:15.850
Doesn't that mean Lupin and his superior 
brainpower will have a huge advantage?

00:04:15.850 --> 00:04:19.560
Not to mention, a safe created by a couple 
of numskulls with zero brainpower...

00:04:19.560 --> 00:04:21.920
Lupin will have that thing open in a flash!

00:04:21.920 --> 00:04:24.070
Say something, sir!

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:28.210
Having zero brainpower is 
the key to us beating Lupin!

00:04:28.930 --> 00:04:31.210
How do you figure that?!

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:35.210
All right, people. Simmer down!

00:04:35.210 --> 00:04:38.720
We... Ow! We have a plan! Tell them, sir!

00:04:38.720 --> 00:04:41.980
The plan we came up with to beat Lupin III...

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:42.720
Not Amazing

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:45.970
Brain

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:45.970
Power

00:04:42.720 --> 00:04:44.430
...is basically this.

00:04:43.220 --> 00:04:43.720
Amazing

00:04:43.970 --> 00:04:44.220
Amazing

00:04:44.430 --> 00:04:45.970
Not Amazing

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:44.630
Amazing

00:04:46.190 --> 00:04:49.380
Now, my brother with his lack of brainpower 
has the advantage over Lupin!

00:04:49.380 --> 00:04:51.220
Sweet, ain't it?! I beat Lupin!

00:04:51.220 --> 00:04:52.730
What do you think, ladies and gentlemen?

00:04:54.430 --> 00:04:57.810
This safe only opens when it 
detects a brainpower rating of zero!

00:04:57.810 --> 00:05:00.470
So my big bro can open it...

00:05:00.470 --> 00:05:04.820
...but it's never gonna open 
for Lupin and his 300 rating!

00:05:05.230 --> 00:05:06.980
Isn't it fabulous?!

00:05:07.300 --> 00:05:11.630
We have just demonstrated 
a way to beat Lupin III!

00:05:12.990 --> 00:05:15.360
Now, gentlemen, if you'd be so kind...

00:05:15.370 --> 00:05:16.870
<b>BRAINPOWER</b>

00:05:22.630 --> 00:05:24.630
<b>We built
a safe</b>

00:05:24.630 --> 00:05:26.260
<b>BRAINPOWER</b>

00:05:31.490 --> 00:05:32.880
It's open!

00:05:32.880 --> 00:05:34.890
This thing might actually keep Lupin out!

00:05:34.890 --> 00:05:36.410
That's right!

00:05:34.890 --> 00:05:40.230
<b>Greater Tokyo Bank
 President</b>

00:05:36.410 --> 00:05:38.020
With this safe and its inventors,

00:05:38.020 --> 00:05:40.220
even the dreaded Lupin is nothing to fear!

00:05:40.220 --> 00:05:43.220
Lupin III, take your best shot!

00:05:43.860 --> 00:05:45.860
Oomori 
Ramen

00:05:49.360 --> 00:05:53.110
Sounds like fun to me, Lupin. 
Why don't you try cracking it?

00:05:55.360 --> 00:05:57.800
It doesn't bug you that they 
just picked a fight with you?

00:05:57.800 --> 00:05:59.880
Aren't you the grandson of 
Arsène Lupin, the gentleman thief?

00:06:01.620 --> 00:06:04.630
You're just gonna ignore 
their challenge? How dull...

00:06:05.010 --> 00:06:06.760
<b>We are closed to deal with some personal business.

00:06:05.070 --> 00:06:08.100
You're a household name. Must be nice.

00:06:08.380 --> 00:06:10.640
Criminals don't do requests.

00:06:11.800 --> 00:06:16.650
Having the world's biggest brain and famous 
lineage will make dodging the fallout easy.

00:06:17.030 --> 00:06:21.010
This big ol' brain of mine is the problem! 
The safe won't open because of it.

00:06:21.010 --> 00:06:23.140
Though, I bet <i>your</i> brain 
would open it, easy, Jigen.

00:06:23.510 --> 00:06:26.910
You might as well try. That thing'll 
probably pop open as soon as it sees you.

00:06:27.190 --> 00:06:30.000
Anyway, I never sent those guys a warning!

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:32.140
You sure that cavity hasn't 
rotted your brain?

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:37.970
Look, just go and break that safe already!

00:06:37.970 --> 00:06:41.800
Wow. I never thought I'd see the famous 
Fujiko Mine so eager to see my exploits!

00:06:42.120 --> 00:06:45.660
You must really be bored. 
No rich suitors turned up lately?

00:06:46.370 --> 00:06:47.550
That's not it at all!

00:06:47.550 --> 00:06:51.440
I'm just curious about who 
phoned in the phony warning!

00:06:52.020 --> 00:06:54.910
I don't believe you. Here I am, 
beside myself with worry,

00:06:54.910 --> 00:06:56.940
and you act like you've 
got no interest in it at all!

00:06:58.940 --> 00:06:59.940
Lupin.

00:07:00.360 --> 00:07:03.600
How about you pay me back 
for those smokes I bought you?

00:07:05.820 --> 00:07:06.930
Here you go.

00:07:07.550 --> 00:07:10.940
Oh, yeah. You still owe me for 
that coffee the other day.

00:07:15.990 --> 00:07:19.340
And there's the time I paid for gas...

00:07:22.940 --> 00:07:25.830
Lupin, I have come to collect what 
I'm owed for the rice I paid for...

00:07:23.080 --> 00:07:25.840
<b>We are closed to deal with some personal business.

00:07:27.220 --> 00:07:28.590
Oh, fine!

00:07:29.430 --> 00:07:31.240
How much do you vultures want from me?!

00:07:31.240 --> 00:07:34.580
The great Lupin with his 300 brainpower
 is gonna go crack that safe! Satisfied?!

00:07:34.580 --> 00:07:36.620
Got get 'em, professor!

00:07:36.620 --> 00:07:39.090
You should've said that at the start.

00:07:41.500 --> 00:07:44.350
So I figure, less is more in this case.

00:07:44.770 --> 00:07:46.760
Watch closely.

00:07:53.170 --> 00:07:54.570
Hey, Lupin!

00:07:57.630 --> 00:07:58.790
Lupin?

00:08:05.330 --> 00:08:08.580
Well, damn. He might actually pull this off.

00:08:09.770 --> 00:08:11.450
See?

00:08:11.450 --> 00:08:13.600
I looked brain-dead, didn't I?

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:17.230
That's really impressive!
 You genuinely looked like a simpleton.

00:08:17.230 --> 00:08:20.090
I thought you'd finally lost your marbles!

00:08:20.520 --> 00:08:22.250
Oh, really?

00:08:22.250 --> 00:08:25.750
Well, guess I'd better go 
pay off my debts...

00:08:35.440 --> 00:08:39.440
This'll be easy. I gobble up 
safes like these for breakfast.

00:08:35.450 --> 00:08:38.370
<b>BRAINPOWER</b>

00:08:47.460 --> 00:08:51.710
<b>BRAINPOWER</b>

00:08:53.960 --> 00:08:57.270
What are we gonna do? 
His brainpower's dropping like crazy!

00:08:57.270 --> 00:08:59.200
Okay! I'm a-gonna go help him!

00:08:59.200 --> 00:09:00.130
S-Sir!

00:08:59.370 --> 00:09:01.210
Big bro! Stay!

00:09:01.220 --> 00:09:03.230
<b>BRAINPOWER</b>

00:09:03.690 --> 00:09:06.230
You can do it! You're almost there!

00:09:06.230 --> 00:09:08.480
<b>We built 
a safe</b>

00:09:08.480 --> 00:09:12.480
<b>BRAINPOWER</b>

00:09:13.230 --> 00:09:15.450
Whew, thank goodness...

00:09:15.450 --> 00:09:16.980
He was so friggin' close!

00:09:20.700 --> 00:09:24.490
Even if all he did was space out, 
this is attempted larceny!

00:09:26.740 --> 00:09:29.270
Lupin! Give yourself up!

00:09:31.360 --> 00:09:33.240
Lupin! You're under arrest!

00:09:33.960 --> 00:09:35.720
Wozzat?

00:09:39.100 --> 00:09:40.540
Lupin?

00:09:41.980 --> 00:09:45.630
I'd have to really be brainless 
to get caught like this!

00:09:46.010 --> 00:09:47.270
Whoa!

00:09:47.780 --> 00:09:49.010
Blammo!

00:09:52.070 --> 00:09:53.030
<b>You lose</b>

00:09:53.020 --> 00:09:54.590
I lose?

00:09:56.020 --> 00:09:57.490
Better luck next time!

00:09:57.490 --> 00:09:59.520
See ya, Pops!

00:09:59.520 --> 00:10:02.030
Don't you mock me! After him!

00:10:02.300 --> 00:10:04.500
I dunno what's goin' down here,
 but I'm a-goin' with them!

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:06.760
Stay, Big Bro!

00:10:07.780 --> 00:10:10.050
That was a good try, Lupin!

00:10:11.200 --> 00:10:13.540
Gotta love an energetic, amiable adversary!

00:10:13.540 --> 00:10:14.920
After him!

00:10:16.040 --> 00:10:20.050
As you just witnessed, Lupin was 
unable to crack the bank's safe!

00:10:20.560 --> 00:10:22.670
All thanks to these brilliant individuals!

00:10:23.110 --> 00:10:25.550
They beat Lupin with his 
300-point brainpower!

00:10:25.550 --> 00:10:28.050
Nice! Hooray for the Greater Tokyo Bank!

00:10:29.320 --> 00:10:30.940
Come see us again, Lupin!

00:10:30.940 --> 00:10:33.760
Big Bro! Our shop's gonna be famous now!

00:10:33.760 --> 00:10:36.950
That means we'll get lotsa work! 
And we can pay back the money we owe!

00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:39.950
<b>We built
a safe</b>

00:10:39.950 --> 00:10:40.070
<b>You lose</b>

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:40.240
<b>You lose</b>

00:10:40.280 --> 00:10:40.320
<b>You lose</b>

00:10:40.360 --> 00:10:44.950
<b>You lose</b>

00:10:44.950 --> 00:10:45.080
Nice try

00:10:45.200 --> 00:10:45.240
Nice try

00:10:45.290 --> 00:10:45.330
Nice try

00:10:45.370 --> 00:10:49.960
Nice try

00:10:49.960 --> 00:10:51.710
Oomori
Ramen

00:10:55.570 --> 00:10:59.790
This sucks! And it's your fault, 
Lupin! You're too smart!

00:11:01.370 --> 00:11:04.550
You always have to be the hotshot, don't you?

00:11:05.710 --> 00:11:07.200
What do you want from me?!

00:11:07.200 --> 00:11:09.020
Zero brainpower is near 
impossible for humans!

00:11:09.020 --> 00:11:09.680
Right, Jigen?

00:11:12.490 --> 00:11:13.760
I know!

00:11:13.760 --> 00:11:16.760
We can whittle down 
your brainpower, bit by bit!

00:11:19.120 --> 00:11:20.770
Fujiko's hit on something there.

00:11:21.320 --> 00:11:23.790
All right, for starters, Fujiko...

00:11:24.150 --> 00:11:25.630
...take off some clothes.

00:11:25.630 --> 00:11:27.890
What are you even saying?!

00:11:27.890 --> 00:11:31.460
We've gotta rid the brilliant 
Professor Lupin of his intelligence, right?

00:11:32.450 --> 00:11:36.020
Well, when men see women in the buff,

00:11:36.020 --> 00:11:38.290
their mental faculties 
tend to become impaired.

00:11:40.250 --> 00:11:43.790
Oh, yeah, okay! I wanna be dumb!

00:11:43.790 --> 00:11:45.590
Why are you taking <i>your</i> clothes off?!

00:11:45.590 --> 00:11:46.640
So my pants don't get in the way—

00:11:46.640 --> 00:11:48.640
<b>Brainpower Monitor</b>

00:11:47.700 --> 00:11:49.640
Hey, that's it! That's how we'll do it.

00:11:54.150 --> 00:11:59.400
Oomori 
Ramen

00:11:55.760 --> 00:11:57.180
Here you go!

00:11:57.180 --> 00:11:57.970
Hup!

00:12:02.400 --> 00:12:04.480
Come on, Lupin! Stop trying to dodge.

00:12:04.480 --> 00:12:06.400
All right, come to me...

00:12:07.150 --> 00:12:10.150
G-Goemon! Save me from these lunatics!

00:12:10.150 --> 00:12:14.900
My grandmother once told me that adding 
pine cones to your soba is good for health.

00:12:15.240 --> 00:12:16.920
S-Say what?

00:12:17.040 --> 00:12:32.890
<b>Current</b>

00:12:17.040 --> 00:12:32.890
<b>Brainpower</b>

00:12:19.510 --> 00:12:21.170
Th-That reeks!

00:12:28.850 --> 00:12:29.180
<b>LUPIN</b>

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:56.290
<b>Current</b>

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:56.290
<b>Brainpower</b>

00:12:33.610 --> 00:12:37.020
I phoned in the warning for you, Lupin.

00:12:37.510 --> 00:12:39.960
Now, you can focus on your training.

00:12:39.960 --> 00:12:41.770
All right, let's push him harder!

00:12:42.170 --> 00:12:44.780
You guys can slack off 
if you want, y'know...

00:12:44.780 --> 00:12:46.650
Don't be ridiculous, buddy.

00:12:46.650 --> 00:12:48.790
He's right. Just bear with it for now.

00:12:48.790 --> 00:12:50.290
Please, Goemon!

00:12:50.290 --> 00:12:54.540
My grandmother recommends broth made 
from earthworms as an herbal remedy.

00:12:56.370 --> 00:13:10.390
<b>Current</b>

00:12:56.370 --> 00:13:10.390
<b>Brainpower</b>

00:13:13.790 --> 00:13:15.420
All right, we're nearly there.

00:13:15.420 --> 00:13:18.530
I've always wanted to give 
Lupin this kind of treatment.

00:13:18.530 --> 00:13:21.710
Still, his brainpower hasn't hit zero yet.

00:13:21.710 --> 00:13:24.320
Even though it's almost 
the day of the heist!

00:13:26.160 --> 00:13:27.900
Come on, no more rest!

00:13:27.900 --> 00:13:30.420
Time for the last spurt, Lupin!

00:13:30.420 --> 00:13:33.150
All right, time to kill some brain cells.

00:13:33.150 --> 00:13:34.700
And to hell with the consequences!

00:13:40.210 --> 00:13:42.710
Oomori
Ramen

00:13:43.760 --> 00:13:45.470
<b>Greater Tokyo Bank</b>

00:13:44.270 --> 00:13:47.970
Lupin phoned in another warning?

00:13:47.970 --> 00:13:50.860
We've had so many new customers
opening accounts with us,

00:13:47.970 --> 00:13:54.480
<b>Money</b>

00:13:50.860 --> 00:13:53.880
we've made more money than 
I know what to do with!

00:13:54.470 --> 00:13:56.050
Lupin...

00:13:56.050 --> 00:13:57.240
Good! So good!

00:13:57.850 --> 00:14:00.660
If it means chowin' down on grub this good,
 I hope Lupin does a good job!

00:14:00.660 --> 00:14:02.570
We're not supposed to root for him.

00:14:02.570 --> 00:14:05.410
There's plenty more ice cream 
where that came from.

00:14:05.410 --> 00:14:09.230
We're bound to make even 
more money, thanks to Lupin!

00:14:10.500 --> 00:14:12.830
Yay! Ice cream!

00:14:13.290 --> 00:14:15.900
So good! Can we have more?

00:14:24.760 --> 00:14:26.760
<b>Wisdom</b>

00:14:36.760 --> 00:14:40.130
Lupin, it's time to show off 
the fruits of your training!

00:14:40.150 --> 00:14:42.650
<b>Brainpower</b>

00:14:55.370 --> 00:14:58.150
It's getting hard to lower his 
brainpower any further...

00:14:58.500 --> 00:15:00.930
Maybe he's built up some kind of resistance.

00:15:01.320 --> 00:15:04.260
We've barely got any time left!

00:15:04.260 --> 00:15:07.430
We have to find a way to get it
 lower before the big day.

00:15:07.430 --> 00:15:10.870
I know... maybe we can 
try the direct approach!

00:15:10.870 --> 00:15:13.890
Whoa, hang on. He'll be dead 
before he's dumb, that way.

00:15:16.000 --> 00:15:18.470
I know Lupin will pull through, somehow!

00:15:18.470 --> 00:15:22.180
We've come so far! It just <i>has</i> to work!

00:15:24.880 --> 00:15:26.450
What now, Big Bro?

00:15:27.650 --> 00:15:28.690
Big Bro?

00:15:29.730 --> 00:15:31.970
Y-You can do it, Lupin!

00:15:31.970 --> 00:15:34.450
S'okay! I know you can! Even I could do it!

00:15:34.450 --> 00:15:36.450
<b>Brainpower</b>

00:15:37.280 --> 00:15:38.870
Of all the shameful—

00:15:38.870 --> 00:15:40.500
Don't interrupt the show!

00:15:40.500 --> 00:15:42.830
Sir, this is an obstruction of justice!

00:15:43.830 --> 00:15:45.840
<b>We built
a safe</b>

00:15:45.840 --> 00:15:49.340
<b>Brainpower</b>

00:15:51.830 --> 00:15:54.330
Yes! We win again!

00:15:54.330 --> 00:15:56.840
If you keep this up, 
I may have to arrest you!

00:15:56.840 --> 00:16:00.510
Big Bro... We won, didn't we?

00:16:05.410 --> 00:16:06.860
B-Big Bro?

00:16:10.110 --> 00:16:11.620
Lupin!

00:16:11.620 --> 00:16:12.200
Big Bro?!

00:16:13.190 --> 00:16:14.690
Lupin!

00:16:15.550 --> 00:16:18.640
Lupin, you tried so hard!

00:16:18.640 --> 00:16:21.120
There's not a huge difference 
between zero and one!

00:16:21.120 --> 00:16:23.200
Can't we just say he opened it?!

00:16:23.410 --> 00:16:25.830
I know! I'm gonna open it for you!

00:16:25.830 --> 00:16:26.700
Big Bro?!

00:16:26.700 --> 00:16:28.850
Lupin, it's okay now!

00:16:29.880 --> 00:16:31.600
Hold on a second.

00:16:34.210 --> 00:16:35.330
Lupin?!

00:16:35.330 --> 00:16:38.870
Getting a full-blooded 
pep talk like that one...

00:16:38.870 --> 00:16:42.650
...is enough to mend a fella who's 
had the brains beaten out of him.

00:16:42.650 --> 00:16:44.100
Lupin!

00:16:44.880 --> 00:16:48.720
I appreciate it, big guy. 
"Not a huge difference," right?

00:16:48.720 --> 00:16:50.610
I like the way you think.

00:16:50.950 --> 00:16:52.350
B-Big Bro?

00:16:52.670 --> 00:16:57.000
All righty, it's time for the world's greatest 
intellect and his 300 points of brainpower...

00:16:57.000 --> 00:17:01.130
to demonstrate how he 
goes about cracking a safe!

00:17:01.120 --> 00:17:03.620
<b>BRAINPOWER</b>

00:17:03.610 --> 00:17:06.800
Amazing! But now, he's too smart to open it!

00:17:06.800 --> 00:17:07.630
Lupin...

00:17:07.630 --> 00:17:12.250
Behold! Here's the solution the brilliant 
brain of Lupin III has rustled up!

00:17:12.250 --> 00:17:13.930
Fishy, fishy, fishy!

00:17:21.640 --> 00:17:24.390
<b>BRAINPOWER</b>

00:17:24.640 --> 00:17:25.910
He's even eatin' the bones!

00:17:25.910 --> 00:17:27.540
His brainpower's going up!

00:17:27.540 --> 00:17:28.900
What's going on?

00:17:28.900 --> 00:17:32.380
Oh, I get it! Blueback fish have something 
in them that makes you smarter!

00:17:32.030 --> 00:17:32.190
<b>A</b>

00:17:32.190 --> 00:17:32.360
<b>A mega</b>

00:17:32.360 --> 00:17:32.530
<b>A mega-brainy</b>

00:17:32.380 --> 00:17:35.520
A mega-brainy fatty acid! I saw it on TV!

00:17:32.530 --> 00:17:32.690
<b>A mega-brainy fatty</b>

00:17:32.690 --> 00:17:32.780
<b>A mega-brainy fatty acid</b>

00:17:32.780 --> 00:17:33.990
<b>A mega-brainy fatty acid</b>

00:17:33.990 --> 00:17:40.160
<b>A mega-brainy fatty acid</b>

00:17:35.520 --> 00:17:38.920
By consuming a ton of that 
mega-brainy fatty acid,

00:17:38.920 --> 00:17:40.850
he's making himself smarter!

00:17:40.850 --> 00:17:43.190
How's that gonna help?

00:17:43.190 --> 00:17:45.210
<b>We built
a safe</b>

00:17:47.620 --> 00:17:50.100
Go! Go! You can do it!

00:17:50.630 --> 00:17:51.380
<b>We built
a safe</b>

00:17:55.630 --> 00:17:58.390
<b>BRAINPOWER</b>

00:17:58.390 --> 00:18:00.390
<b>BRAINPOWER</b>

00:18:00.380 --> 00:18:01.670
It opened!

00:18:01.670 --> 00:18:05.400
I guess the difference between an idiot 
and a genius really is paper thin!

00:18:05.400 --> 00:18:10.440
I see! Brainpower 300 was the max it could measure, 
so brainpower 301 caused an overflow!

00:18:10.440 --> 00:18:13.590
One more point forced it to reset 
exactly like a digital clock does.

00:18:13.590 --> 00:18:15.770
Whoa! Hold it right there!

00:18:16.150 --> 00:18:18.280
Lupin! You're under arrest!

00:18:22.270 --> 00:18:23.440
Lupin?

00:18:24.020 --> 00:18:25.080
Are you—

00:18:25.420 --> 00:18:26.780
Time to make a run for it, Lupin.

00:18:26.780 --> 00:18:28.570
Don't dawdle, now!

00:18:28.570 --> 00:18:30.010
You okay there, Lupin?

00:18:30.430 --> 00:18:31.810
I'm jus' fine...

00:18:32.670 --> 00:18:34.810
You're not getting away, Lupin!

00:18:36.470 --> 00:18:41.400
Well, he didn't take the money, 
so I guess it all worked out in the end.

00:18:41.400 --> 00:18:43.800
The contest ends in a draw!

00:18:43.800 --> 00:18:46.300
That being the case, good night, 
ladies and gentlemen!

00:18:47.590 --> 00:18:49.600
Our safe didn't win...

00:18:49.600 --> 00:18:51.330
We're gonna lose the workshop, after all.

00:18:51.330 --> 00:18:52.580
I dunno what you mean,

00:18:52.580 --> 00:18:56.690
but us and Lupin... we're the same, ain't we?

00:18:56.690 --> 00:18:59.570
I mean, we just need to eat fish, right?

00:19:00.160 --> 00:19:02.440
Won't eatin' fish mean 
it's all worked out in the end?

00:19:02.440 --> 00:19:03.730
I know!

00:19:04.620 --> 00:19:07.570
Big Bro! We might lose the workshop, but...

00:19:07.920 --> 00:19:12.070
I think, if we work together, 
we can make it somehow!

00:19:12.070 --> 00:19:13.660
Thanks, Big Bro!

00:19:14.080 --> 00:19:15.950
Your safe was really incredible!

00:19:15.950 --> 00:19:18.500
What does it feel like 
to have such low brainpower?

00:19:18.500 --> 00:19:20.830
What will you be inventing next?

00:19:24.320 --> 00:19:26.660
A new power for a new age!

00:19:26.660 --> 00:19:27.590
You know what it is!

00:19:27.600 --> 00:19:37.360
<b>Soy 
Flavor</b>

00:19:27.600 --> 00:19:37.360
<b>Curry
Flavor</b>

00:19:27.850 --> 00:19:28.350
<b>Now on sale!</b>

00:19:27.850 --> 00:19:28.350
<b>Canned Fish!</b>

00:19:27.850 --> 00:19:28.350
<b>Hirameki Inventions</b>

00:19:27.850 --> 00:19:28.350
<b>(Tax inc.)    Yen</b>

00:19:28.070 --> 00:19:29.480
Canned Fish!

00:19:28.600 --> 00:19:29.600
<b>Hirameki Inventions</b>

00:19:28.600 --> 00:19:37.360
<b>Now on sale!</b>

00:19:28.600 --> 00:19:37.360
<b>Canned Fish</b>

00:19:28.600 --> 00:19:37.360
<b>(Tax inc.)    Yen</b>

00:19:29.830 --> 00:19:31.780
Eat fish...

00:19:31.780 --> 00:19:34.270
...and increase your brainpower!

00:19:34.270 --> 00:19:37.360
Collect the stickers that come 
with the cans, and take on Lupin!

00:19:37.360 --> 00:19:46.410
<b>Canned Fish</b>

00:19:37.860 --> 00:19:42.480
<i>And so, after we'd become overnight celebs
and started selling canned blueback fish,</i>

00:19:42.480 --> 00:19:45.730
<i>it got super popular because it tastes
good and makes you smarter!</i>

00:19:46.130 --> 00:19:50.630
<i>And my brother became famous for 
being funny around the neighborhood!</i>

00:19:47.910 --> 00:19:50.620
<b>Let's communicate
 with cats!</b>

00:19:50.630 --> 00:19:55.620
<i>From now on, the two of us are gonna do 
lotsa work so we can pay off our debts.</i>

00:19:55.620 --> 00:19:59.880
Oomori
Ramen

00:19:55.620 --> 00:19:59.880
<i>Lupin III, a lot has happened, 
but we're doin' well!</i>

00:20:00.940 --> 00:20:03.140
Lupin, about that rice money...

00:20:03.140 --> 00:20:05.900
You guys had a lot of fun 
at my expense, didn't you?

00:20:06.260 --> 00:20:10.390
Thinking you could get away with murder just 
'cause you were trying to lower my brainpower!

00:20:10.390 --> 00:20:14.390
Uh, I have an appointment with the 
beautician, so I'm gonna head out now...

00:20:14.390 --> 00:20:17.890
Y-Yeowch, my cavity's suddenly 
started acting up...

00:20:17.890 --> 00:20:20.930
You're all ne'er-do-wells, I suppose.

00:20:20.930 --> 00:20:24.400
It's too much to expect even
 a scintilla of remorse from you, isn't it?

00:20:24.700 --> 00:20:29.540
I guess our esteemed professor wants to be 
a pain in somewhere other than my tooth.

00:20:29.540 --> 00:20:32.360
Okay, fine. Hey, Fujiko, take off your clothes.

00:20:32.960 --> 00:20:34.910
Have you gone soft in the head, too?!

00:20:35.770 --> 00:20:38.420
Come on, make me dumb again!

00:20:38.420 --> 00:20:40.160
Like I said first time...

00:20:40.580 --> 00:20:42.160
Why are you taking <i>your</i> clothes off?!

00:20:45.750 --> 00:20:47.180
So much for that idea.

00:22:15.710 --> 00:22:17.390
I received a request from a guy named Gaston,

00:22:17.390 --> 00:22:19.590
who knows all about my past 
and wants me to steal something.

00:22:19.590 --> 00:22:23.510
This guy was once known as a 
master forger in the underworld.

00:22:23.510 --> 00:22:27.010
And since we've got a bit of history, 
it's not like I can turn him down.

00:22:27.330 --> 00:22:31.230
The part where I steal the painting went 
smoothly enough, but beyond that...

00:22:31.230 --> 00:22:34.460
I gotta tell you, something 
stinks about this whole thing.

00:22:34.460 --> 00:22:37.920
Gaston, what kind of trouble have
 you gotten yourself mixed up in?

00:22:37.920 --> 00:22:40.230
Next time: His Name is Albert.

00:22:37.920 --> 00:22:44.910
<b>His Name is Albert</b>

00:22:40.230 --> 00:22:43.490
I get it. So you're a part of this, too...
